<div class="legend" style="margin-bottom:10px"><span><i class="dot d-done"></i>Done</span><span><i class="dot d-partial"></i>Partly done</span><span><i class="dot d-notdone"></i>Not done</span><span><i class="dot d-unknown"></i>Couldn't check</span><span><i class="dot d-manual"></i>Review yourself</span></div>
